<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0"><dict>
<key>CFBundleExecutable</key><string>Riftlet</string>
<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key><string>com.riftlet.app</string>
<key>CFBundleName</key><string>Riftlet</string>
<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key><string>Riftlet</string>
<key>CFBundlePackageType</key><string>APPL</string>
<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key><string>0.1.0</string>
<key>CFBundleVersion</key><string>1</string>
<key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key><string>13.0</string>
<key>LSUIElement</key><true/>
<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key><true/>
<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key><string>public.app-category.utilities</string>
<key>RiftletBuildChannel</key><string>development</string>
<key>RiftletDeveloperIDSigned</key><false/>
<key>RiftletNotarized</key><false/>
<key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key><string>Riftlet 使用 Google Chrome 向当前 ChatGPT 草稿附加图片，绝不自动发送消息。普通模式尚未启用上传；生成图测试和需明确启动的真实截图内部候选各自隔离，候选只在点击后尝试输入，不代表生产准入。</string>
<key>NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription</key><string>Riftlet 读取系统保存到桌面的新截图，并在本机保留私有副本；不会删除系统原截图。</string>
<key>NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription</key><string>当系统截图保存在文稿中时，Riftlet 读取新截图并在本机保留私有副本；不会删除系统原截图。</string>
<key>NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription</key><string>当系统截图保存在下载中时，Riftlet 读取新截图并在本机保留私有副本；不会删除系统原截图。</string>
